<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-PSV EINDHOVEN CLINCH DUTCH LEAGUE TITLE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PSV EINDHOVEN CLINCH DUTCH LEAGUE TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>PSV Eindhoven clinched their 14th Dutch league championship on Sunday with a 3-1 win over Willem II Tilburg.</p>
<p>Goals from Luc Nilis, Wim Jonk and Gillem de Bilde ensured their victory.</p>
<p>Second-placed Feyenoord also won, beating Heerenveen 4-2, but remained four points behind with only one match to play.</p>
<p>PSV last won the title in 1992.</p>
</text>
